# Private pickaxe denylist — copy to .pickaxe-denylist (gitignored) and fill in.
# One term per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
# These are the operator-specific strings that must NEVER reach a public artifact:
# usernames, home-dir paths, secret-vault names, cloud project/account refs, and
# any persona / family / client names. The pickaxe scans git history (diff content,
# filenames, commit author/committer metadata) for each and fails the publish gate
# on any hit. The built-in denylist only ships the generic op:// pattern.
#
# Example (synthetic — replace with your real terms in the gitignored copy):
synthuser
/home/synthuser
Example-Vault
synthproj0123456789
